     MOVE 16 TO PW-DZ
     PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P > 2048
         MOVE 1 TO PW-CELL(WS-P)
     END-PERFORM
     PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P > 256
         MOVE 0 TO PW-CELL(WS-P)
     END-PERFORM.
