     MOVE 0 TO WS-O3
     PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P > PS-PATH-COUNT
         IF PS-PX(WS-P) = 4 AND PS-PZ(WS-P) < 7
             ADD 1 TO WS-O3
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM.
