     MOVE 0 TO WS-O3
     PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P > PNB-COUNT
         IF PN-X(PNB-NODE(WS-P)) = WS-I AND PN-Y(PNB-NODE(WS-P)) = WS-J AND PN-Z(PNB-NODE(WS-P)) = WS-K
